WEBVTT

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:08.980
Ever heard of Turtle Rock in Asuka?

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.770
Nope.

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:13.180
It faces south,

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.070
but they say, if it ever turns west,
the whole Nara Basin will sink.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:19.490
Like the Crystal Skulls,
where if they're all gathered

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.450
in one place, the world will be destroyed?

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.270
There's a similar legend about this.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:32.240
<b>Red Mask</b>

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:28.100
There's a blue mask, too.
And if the two ever face each other,

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.570
it means goodbye Minami-Kamiyama.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.260
Minami-Kamiyama?

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.470
So maybe this is Nostradamus's Key?

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.330
It was originally an evil god,

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:42.470
but it was split into light and shadow,
and sealed away.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:49.500
<b>Excavated Clay Mask
from Late Joumon Period</b>

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.440
In other words, the two must
never be allowed to meet.

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:49.520
Excavated clay mask from
late Joumon period?

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.680
This is the blue mask?

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.940
It's worth looking at, don't you think?

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:56.580
Wait!

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:00.120
What if we bring them together
and something happens?

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.750
It's not the 21st of July yet.

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:07.300
Abe-sensei and the Principal are
going to Nagano City?

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.280
Excuse me.

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:22.750
Abe-sensei... Welcome back.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.800
Hi... What are you doing, Mikaze-san!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.240
Cooking?

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:30.420
No! I mean, why in my room?

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.840
I came to make dinner.

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:36.360
After I talked to the landlord,
I got the spare key, to come in.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:39.610
Eat up.

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:47.700
How is it?

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.710
It's good.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:51.880
Tastes just like Mom made it.

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.780
Great!

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.330
What did you use for the secret ingredient?

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.880
A little banana and cola.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:04.180
My mom's the only person in the world
who put in banana and cola!

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.930
Why is she doing the exact same thing?

00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:11.850
Um, Abe-sensei? Are you free tonight?

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.940
Are you okay?

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:22.110
I'm sorry. I'm acting weird, aren't I?

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:26.450
Yeah. It's too sudden, right?

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:30.230
You're busy.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.790
Kill the witch!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.230
Destroy the demon's den!

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.030
Kill the witch!

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:41.890
Destroy the demon's den!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.640
The neighborhood's getting together.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:48.490
The neighborhood?

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:50.600
Yes. They're keeping the city safe.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.560
Man, these clothes are so hot.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:00.100
One of your students is gone?

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.230
Uh, yes.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.110
We're all looking for them.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.320
What is this?

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.890
You know what we're talking about, right?

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:35.850
Waldstein Academy, where
you work, is a den of evil.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.580
Destroy the demon's den!

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:43.990
And the witch has returned there.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:47.980
A woman constantly at the center
of every bizarre event...

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:51.510
Someone involved in the
school's founding...

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:55.000
You know who I'm talking about.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.460
Kill the witch!

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:01.040
You know to whom I refer.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:05.610
Say it! Say her name! Say it!

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:10.590
Kumashiro Maya...

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:15.020
But why?

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:20.980
The tengu, the disappearances, the blood-drinking
monsters... It was all her doing.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:26.690
Soon, she will open the door
to Hell and invite it in...

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:29.710
Invite...

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.330
Kill the witch!

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.500
Kill the witch!

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.740
Kill the witch!

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.930
Kill the witch!

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.590
Do you understand now?

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:50.800
She's the key to everything.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.580
And she'll open the door to Hell.

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:56.970
On July 21st.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.980
Nostradamus's Key...

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.770
I want you to do something for me.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:12.320
There's something always protecting her.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.240
Some kind of talisman.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.450
If you can get rid of it,

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.500
we should be able to do
something about her.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:21.770
But...

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:24.250
Please.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:31.770
If we don't destroy her,
Matsushiro is doomed.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.740
I'm glad...

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:51.440
Let's kill the witch.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.770
<b>Archeology Lab</b>

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:03.730
I'm sorry for all the trouble.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:27.150
Don't get so down, just
because this wasn't it.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:32.980
We can find it.

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:36.110
Let's head home.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.540
This way!

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.540
I heard the miso-flavored
ice cream here is good!

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:53.550
Take it. Take it. Take it!

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.520
Stay still!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.360
<i>Let's kill the witch.</i>

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:17.030
What's wrong?

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.040
It's nothing.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.460
The oyaki here is good, I heard!

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.920
The juu'wari soba here is good, I heard!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.000
The shichu...

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.590
The hakutou juice...

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:33.000
The sakamanjuu.

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:35.800
I'll take two!

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.970
Hey, you want to go home?

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:43.430
I'm thirsty. Let's at least get some tea.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:45.640
Tea...

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.600
<i>Let's kill the witch.</i>

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.210
<i>Let's kill the witch.</i>

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:54.780
<i>Let's kill the witch, together!</i>

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:57.150
Stop it!

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:03.640
Bunmei, snap the hell out of it!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.670
Are you a witch?

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:15.800
Mikaze-san told me that you're
at the center of all this.

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.140
That someday, you'll open the door to Hell,

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:20.590
and invite in things not of this world!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.260
What are you talking about?

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:25.550
You're a witch, and...

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:27.110
The heck's wrong with you?

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:28.850
Why would I be a witch?

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:32.560
Then why has all this weird stuff happened,
ever since you returned to the school?

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:36.390
Why is a door to another dimension
opening at Waldstein Academy?

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:38.770
The center of it all?

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:41.990
You're saying I'm Nostradamus's Key?

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:44.180
Are you saying you're not?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.640
Then what if I am?

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:50.990
Will you kill me?

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:55.420
I know.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.590
I've taken a photo of myself with this.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:00.900
The only thing I saw was a skeleton.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:05.360
If I'm the Key, you'd see a
peaceful future, right?

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:07.970
Were you trying to kill yourself?

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:13.230
I told you. To make it work, you need
to think about destroying the object.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:17.790
Stop it.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:18.730
Why?

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:20.450
We won't know unless we try it, right?

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:26.880
Wait! What are you doing?

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.240
Give that back!

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:33.720
Give it back.

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:41.090
Give it back!

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:42.380
Give it back!

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:50.600
You shouldn't go back to Matsushiro.

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:55.020
It's not just Mikaze-san who's after you.

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:57.580
You might be killed!

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:58.940
Like hell I will!

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:12.450
Maya...

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.420
What's going on?

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.420
There's no contact from #6.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:20.880
There's no time left.

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:22.850
Where's the Commander?

00:12:22.850 --> 00:12:24.340
Gone.

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:27.260
Jeez...

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:40.480
It's almost July 21st there.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:45.200
Will we be able to stop it from happening?

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.320
You're certain it's the principal?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.090
Maya! Maya!

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:44.600
Maya! Maya!

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:47.490
Maya! Maya!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:49.890
<i>Maya!</i>

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.130
Kozue!

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:05.480
They said school's canceled today.

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.830
Wh-What's wrong?

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:11.580
Maya-san... Maya-san...

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:12.560
What?

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:13.450
What happened to her?

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:15.120
She was killed!

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:22.190
Someone... Someone killed her!

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:32.690
Is there anything missing from the room?

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:37.450
I haven't been in here very often.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.690
Anything you can tell us...

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:43.420
The notebook...

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:45.280
She always carried a notebook.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.630
A notebook?

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:01.370
I still can't believe she's dead.

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:18.030
Maya-san... She helped me
with all that occult stuff...

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:26.730
She's gone somewhere even my
dowsing rod can't find her.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.530
Cut that out.

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:34.730
It's like she's really dead.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:49.420
I killed her.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:54.140
If I hadn't gotten her involved in looking
for Nostradamus's Key...

00:15:55.440 --> 00:16:00.400
If I hadn't told her she might be the Key...

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:03.010
I was afraid to know.

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:05.100
That was all I thought.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:12.450
If I'd held your hand and
not let it go... Maya...

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:19.170
When I was a kid,

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:24.540
Maya and I always used to talk
with the spirits like this.

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.290
Maya... Why?

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.270
That's it!

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:38.710
What are we?

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:40.580
We're students of Waldstein Academy...

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.270
Of Occult Academy!

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:45.080
That's right.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:50.160
We can do what other people can't.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.110
We'll find out who did it!

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.310
We can do a summoning!

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:54.610
Or a séance!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.740
A ouija board is the simplest way!

00:16:57.170 --> 00:16:58.620
Let's do anything, whatever it is!

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:23.450
<b>Idiot                        Kumashiro Maya</b>

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.380
I don't care if you call me an idiot...

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:29.520
Won't you call me again?

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:33.380
Yell at me again?

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.620
Am I not good enough?

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:46.740
You?

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:48.830
Did you kill her?

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.420
You really are an idiot.

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:12.780
Maya...

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.030
Look at your face.

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:18.070
I'm alive.

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:23.280
The body you saw yesterday
was a fake, made by magic.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:30.250
I've hidden it until now. But I'm a white mage,
in service to the previous principal.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:32.020
Wh-Why?

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:34.190
To deceive the enemy.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:37.970
The previous principal ordered
me to protect Maya.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:41.210
I couldn't reveal myself.

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:44.680
I'm sorry for the trouble I caused you.

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:46.140
It's true.

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:50.990
You're lying.

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.400
She died!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.390
Her body was cold!

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:54.400
We told you, that was a-

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.640
The police said she was dead!

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:58.320
Bunmei...

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:00.080
I-I know.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:02.190
If you're the real Maya,
you should have the notebook.

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:08.740
Miss...

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:16.030
This is...

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:30.310
Thank you, Abe-sensei,

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:34.020
for stealing her talisman.

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:42.600
You almost fooled us into
thinking you were dead.

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:46.170
I guess that to deceive your enemies,
you start by deceiving your friends.

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:02.630
Oh, my. Do you think you can escape?

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.030
From a black mage like me?

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:26.450
You wait here, sensei.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:31.410
I'll take my time killing you,
once I've dealt with them.

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:32.900
Hurry!

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:37.870
Kumashiro Maya, you're going to die.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:39.400
This time, for real!

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:49.010
Kill the witch!

00:20:57.590 --> 00:20:59.520
Miss, this way.

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.200
Kumashiro Maya.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:20.840
The door to Hell will open.

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:23.260
I'll kill anyone who tries to stop me.

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:26.220
Just like your father.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.860
You killed my papa?

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:28.790
You must not...

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:29.700
Let me go!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:31.900
She killed my papa!

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:38.560
I'm sorry, miss.

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:42.400
You run.

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.130
I'll hold them off.

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:09.230
Damn you, white mage!

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:49.480
I can't believe it!

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:51.870
Mikaze-san was an evil witch?

00:23:51.870 --> 00:23:55.770
She was trying to open the door to Hell.
The dimensional rift...

00:23:55.770 --> 00:23:57.390
It's the last battle.

00:23:57.390 --> 00:23:59.330
Bunmei, take a picture
of her with the phone!

00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:01.330
But... But...

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:03.540
There's no time! Hurry!

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:07.000
<i>Me?</i>

00:24:07.300 --> 00:24:09.870
Next time on <i>Occult Academy:</i>

00:24:09.870 --> 00:24:12.470
A thousand wind, the search for beauty.

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:14.820
It's occult, but we can't lose!

00:24:14.840 --> 00:24:19.880
This program is a work of fiction.
Departed spirits, psychic abilities,
aliens, UMAs, etc., do not exist.

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:19.880
Unless you believe in them...
